        "heading": "When to talk to a healthcare provider",
        "text": "<p>Talk to a healthcare provider if you notice any of these signs:</p><ul><li>Someone notices you stop breathing for a few seconds while you sleep.</li><li>You wake up gasping or choking.</li><li>You feel very sleepy during the day.</li><li>Your snoring is new or very loud.</li></ul><p>These signs can't diagnose anything. They only mean it's worth getting checked by a professional.</p>",
