            "text": "If something goes wrong",
            "level": "h2",
            "anchor": "if-something-goes-wrong"
          }
        },
        "content_8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you feel discomfort, stop using the device and talk to a healthcare provider. Our customer care team can't assess medical cases.</p><p>If a serious problem happens with a product we sold, we'll also report it to the manufacturer and, where required, to the FDA.</p>"
